    "支持普通歌词和带时间轴的 LRC 文本。保存后仅覆盖 App 资料库，不会改写原始音频标签。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Supports plain lyrics and timestamped LRC text. Saving only updates the app library and does not rewrite original audio tags." } },
